ct pose in mind, so I'll leave most of the creative decisions up to you. For reference, she has a close relation to death, is very confident and almost has a personality similar to Hu Tao from genshin impact. However she also has a very sad side to her when she's alone, if you'd like to portray that instead. \n\nI would use this request on YouTube as a visual for one of my original songs. \n\nHere is some reference material for her design: \n\nhttps://twitter.com/achilliart/status/1520750259135201281?s=20&t=7RyO4xIXJ0ey7vchnq9NoA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ARuHe_La/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/79737e42/uploads/origins/f26822b9-a321-465b-9122-0f8be0ac7656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8e1560bba554865937c3320baa4f264", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/79737e42/uploads/origins/f26822b9-a321-465b-9122-0f8be0ac7656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8e1560bba554865937c3320baa4f264, https://si.imgix.net/79737e42/uploads/origins/f26822b9-a321-465b-9122-0f8be0ac7656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ad63823949d3cfcb4f901374ac7a707 2x, https://si.imgix.net/79737e42/uploads/origins/f26822b9-a321-465b-9122-0f8be0ac7656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2edda6be332e1785396b320d4fdaee21 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello teacher!!! Thank you for reading my commission!\nI want to commission a teacher to draw this child ❤!\n\n-I would like to commission you to draw her rather \"sickly\" look!\n-If you want, feel free to change her costume.\n\nHer name is \"Tenju Rumi\".\nNotes on her appearance\n-She is not tall, only 140cm.\n-Because she has trouble sleeping, she has serious dark circles under her eyes and a pale complexion.\n-She has a mole on the right corner of her eye\n-Her hair is not particularly long! \"Please refer to the corresponding picture for the hair length (sorry for your trouble!)\n-There are some scars on the inside of her left thigh\n\nCharacter story reference\n-Not very good at communicating with others\n-She doesn't have a sense of distance from people she knows well.\n-Has a raven companion named \"bad thing\"\n\nAbove! Thank you!\nI put the reference image in Google! Thank you again for reading my invitation!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wv_uy8Cg63q7llstK3AfqQ93UEZwd_OJ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ARuHe_La/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7f4ce70/uploads/origins/5a4a2ef5-14ed-43d9-961b-30e0c94a3dc5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a0637ed7d28d5a8a9586adce4718ce3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b7f4ce70/uploads/origins/5a4a2ef5-14ed-43d9-961b-30e0c94a3dc5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a0637ed7d28d5a8a9586adce4718ce3, https://si.imgix.net/b7f4ce70/uploads/origins/5a4a2ef5-14ed-43d9-961b-30e0c94a3dc5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a238a75d8c5bc6e856e3904746fca00 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b7f4ce70/uploads/origins/5a4a2ef5-14ed-43d9-961b-30e0c94a3dc5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4585b27efebc604a3b9c1e456d93d06 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I'd like you to draw my character!\nIt's a boy with dog ears.\nPlease draw him holding a stuffed rabbit!\n\nCharacter: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fxl0U09CzbkghLLxaPSpYLuxd_9G4dVn?usp=sharing\n\nPlease feel free to draw me! Thank you very much!\n\nPosting on SNS, icons, headers, thumbnails, etc.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fxl0U09CzbkghLLxaPSpYLuxd_9G4dVn?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ARuHe_La/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f82dcfbc/uploads/origins/8fdfa724-28a4-48e5-a04b-d6e5d2c61fc2?bg=%23fff&auto=